		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  copie de table --> copier les comment on column]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=16536#p16536"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>voiici la requete finale<br />SELECT a.attname,&#160; y.description<br />FROM pg_class c<br />JOIN pg_attribute a ON a.attrelid = c.oid<br />JOIN pg_namespace n ON c.relnamespace = n.oid<br />join pg_description y ON y.objoid=a.attrelid<br />WHERE relname = &#039;co&#039; and nspname = &#039;msaw&#039; <br />AND attnum &gt; 0<br />and attnum = objsubid<br />ORDER BY a.attnum;</p><p>merci</p>]]></content>
